OL,3,GNEWSA'My new job as a tour guide turned
OL,4,Aout to be fake'
OL,5,
OL,6,FWhen Ella was offered a job as a tour
OL,7,Fguide, it seemed like an exciting
OL,8,Fopportunity.
OL,10,FThe 23-year-old was hired on the spot
OL,11,Fby Haggis Waggon Tours boss Darryl
OL,12,FSmith after meeting him at a job fair
OL,13,Fin Paisley.
OL,15,FJust a week later, Ella was listed as a
OL,16,F"guest favourite" on the group's
OL,17,Fwebsite, despite never having done a
OL,18,Ftour for them or meeting any customers.
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,423,420,260,160,0,100
